\section{Experience}

\runsubsection{Ecobee}
\descript{| Senior Data Scientist}
\location{Jun 2021 – present | Toronto, ON}
\vspace{\topsep}
\begin{tightemize}
\item Lead development of Model Predictive Control (MPC) optimization algorithms in C++ on embedded IoT devices to increase customer HVAC energy savings and improve thermal comfort.
\item Solved IoT device temperature calibration regression model generalization issues by preprocessing training data and adding k-fold cross validation to feature engineering.
\item Accelerated thermodynamics predictive modelling team cycle time from weeks to days by automating training, validation, and deployment in GCP using Python and Docker.
\item Lead external research collaborations with 4+  groups related to HVAC controls and simulation software and 2 industry partnership MM\$ projects.
\end{tightemize}
\sectionsep

\runsubsection{Ecobee}
\descript{| Data Scientist}
\location{Oct 2018 – Jun 2021 | Toronto, ON}
\vspace{\topsep}
