\section{Research}
\runsubsection{\href{https://control.ee.ethz.ch}{Automatic Control Lab}}
\descript{| Master Student}
\location{Sep 2017 – Oct 2018 | Zurich, Switzerland}
\begin{tightemize}
\item Worked with Dr. Annika Eichler on project combining Model Predictive Control (MPC) and online Bayesian learning for building controls.
\item Developed Python library to model building thermodynamics and run MPC simulation experiments on HPC cluster.
\item Developed online Bayesian Linear Discriminant Analysis (LDA) classifier for thermal comfort using PyMC3 with an MCMC algorithm.
\item Developed predictive model of occupancy probability in Python using Markov chains and change point detection algorithm.
